# Every page of the built-in guide: its first two screens, for the layout
# audit (tools/rgnano_layout_audit.py). Loading checks that no line is
# wider than the screen and every link lands on a heading that exists.
route boot.new_project_random
expect_view song
down n
press k 80
up n
press a 80
wait 200
press b 80
wait 60
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
wait 60
expect_selected_text Your First Song
press a 80
wait 100
